{
  "about": "Encoded scores the song library is converted from: LilyPond files from the Mutopia Project (each with its own licence line, checked out from the repo and commit below), and ABC and MusicXML files from the collections in origins (each origin names the file in it that states its licence, and the text that file must contain). tools/render-sources.py copies each score into sources/<id>/ and renders <id>.mid (LilyPond for Mutopia, abc2midi for ABC, music21 for MusicXML); tools/midi-to-track.mjs converts that MIDI file. melody and bass name MIDI tracks (\"8\" every channel of track 8, \"1:2\" one channel); start is the beat (quarter notes from the start of the file) where the excerpt's first full bar begins, lead the pickup before it, bars the number of full bars, end the beat after which no new note starts. tempo is set only where the source has no usable tempo marking. key and mode set the key where the notes alone can't tell it (a modal folk tune). number picks one tune from an ABC file with several; order sets the order of an ABC tune's parts.",
  "repo": "https://github.com/MutopiaProject/MutopiaProject",
  "commit": "2144afd6f52d56c5b6995b8b589ef1268b3139f0",
  "converted": "2026-10-15",
